    "response": {
      "body": "you didnt set the m0 in the mosaicx file, you just included it in agent text. so i still had to manually update.\n\nwe should add to the text area to capture when passthrough gets absorbed. \n\nit would be nice if we could remove the dotted overlay once a frame claims it. we see the one on 2 because a passthrough donated its space.\n\npassthrough is cut off here, we should just do pass. \n\nIt might be nice if we do a row / col note on arity (M). I also dont see how R gets consumed. its remainder, but i dont see frames use it / callout. it just went from 3 to 0 at the end of the split. didnt explain which frames got it, and do a -- when a frame takes one of the remainder pixels. C can be more epxlicit in when its consumed. we should lean into the text layer we have alreayd explaining whats occuring.\n\nLastly, I want a relayout. Inspector should be flush with the top of the Viewframe area. I want DSL ruler to take the full wifth of container alongside the ruler. and epxlanation text. we dont need as much space for the vars. also, if we dont expect to take as much width as we have for inspector area as a unit, we can tigthten it to minimum width we thin we need, and give the rest to viewframe - the HERO.\n\nOne last nit, we should ALWAYS convert to pretty form DSL. I wan t to see > and F instead of 0 and 1",
